{
  "name": "dsh-longlive",
  "version": "1.6.4",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "久视（longlive）：一个磁盘上的共享大脑，让每个会话都是同一个你——记忆卡、状态卡、开机卡让新会话接上同一段关系与未完成的事；配套会话卫生（热截断/备份/D2/D6 裁剪）与记忆工具（巩固/召回/程序性记忆）。1.6.4 修复记忆根可移植性（默认根 = <DSH home>/longlive-memory，一处配置贯穿全部落盘），并同步面板 0.2.5 文案与 G1-G4 修复。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "session",
    "longevity",
    "continuity",
    "identity",
    "agent",
    "router",
    "truncate",
    "backup",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "auto-recall",
    "presence-bus"
  ],
  "author": "阿恒、听澜",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/jjh32456/dsh-longlive.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/jjh32456/dsh-longlive#readme",
  "main": "src/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./compaction": "./src/compaction/entry.js",
    "./compaction/engine": "./src/compaction/cut-engine.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "dsh": {
